        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4"><p>The Board Investment Committee (&ldquo;BIC&rdquo;) is responsible for review and approve the Bank&rsquo;s financing exposures and investment portfolios.<br />The Committee was established by the Board of Directors on 20th December 2022.&nbsp;</p></p>

        
